  "doc_diffs": {
    "qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/DATA.md": "--- old/qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/DATA.md\n+++ new/qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/DATA.md\n@@ -73,7 +73,7 @@\n \n ## 输出\n \n-输出HDF5必须包含`wave_response`，float64 [Nt,Nr,1]，轴依次为times、probe_ids行、单一标量分量。还须精确复制`times`、`probe_ids`和`probe_coordinates`作为输出支持数组；不复制源或单元标志，不附加未声明结果。\n+输出HDF5必须包含`wave_response`，float64 [Nt,Nr,1]，轴依次为times、probe_ids行、单一标量分量。还须精确复制`times`和`probe_ids`作为输出支持数组；不重复点坐标，不复制源或单元标志，不附加未声明结果。\n \n `outputs`恰有对象`response`，array=`wave_response`、location=`probes`、time_axis=`physical`、dtype=`float64`、kind=`scalar`、component_shape=[1]、components=[\"value\"]、value_kind=`point`。quantity和unit在SH为`sh_displacement`、`m`，在声学为`acoustic_displacement_potential`、`kg/m`。\n \n",
    "qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/instruction.md": "--- old/qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/instruction.md\n+++ new/qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/instruction.md\n@@ -14,4 +14,4 @@\n \n 提供的离线环境已配置原始源码和构建。开发文件位于 `/opt/specfem-repair-build/upstream/src/specfem2D/get_MPI.F90`。改动后先删除 `/opt/specfem-repair-build/upstream/obj/get_MPI.spec.o` 和 `/opt/specfem-repair-build/upstream/bin/xspecfem2D`，再执行 `cmake --build /opt/specfem-repair-build --target repair_sources`。该目标调用上游真实构建；不能靠已有二进制或文件时间戳代替重编。\n \n-考试包根目录支持离线 `python -m pip install .`。在提供的运行环境中，运行 `python public/run_case.py --input samples/01/input/problem.json --output /tmp/result.h5`；然后以 `python -m caeoj grade --input samples/01/input/problem.json --output /tmp/result.h5 --grading samples/01/reference/grading.json` 检查公开样例。`public/CMakeLists.txt` 负责既有真实构建的重编入口；从源码重新配置时使用GNU Fortran、OpenMPI、Scotch及 `--with-mpi --enable-double-precision MPI_INC=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/openmpi/include FC=gfortran MPIFC=mpif90 FCFLAGS=\"-O2 -fallow-argument-mismatch\" FLAGS_CHECK=\"-O2 -fallow-argument-mismatch\"`，再执行上游 `make`。保留所附许可证。\n+考试包根目录支持离线 `python -m pip install .`。安装后先执行 `cd qbank/19-solver-repair/19.6-waves/parallel-pml-reduction-repair/`，再运行 `python public/run_case.py --input samples/01/input/problem.json --output /tmp/result.h5`；然后以 `python -m caeoj grade --input samples/01/input/problem.json --output /tmp/result.h5 --grading samples/01/reference/grading.json` 检查公开样例。`public/CMakeLists.txt` 负责既有真实构建的重编入口；从源码重新配置时使用GNU Fortran、OpenMPI、Scotch及 `--with-mpi --enable-double-precision MPI_INC=/usr/lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/openmpi/include FC=gfortran MPIFC=mpif90 FCFLAGS=\"-O2 -fallow-argument-mismatch\" FLAGS_CHECK=\"-O2 -fallow-argument-mismatch\"`，再执行上游 `make`。保留所附许可证。\n"
  },
